            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.5.3

- Hide Fable: tick it at the bottom (next to 5-hour) to take the one-model weekly limit off the screen. It never stops the whole account, so nothing else changes.
- View is now one click: each click switches Regular → Compact → Grouped.
- Click the version number at the bottom to check for updates.
]]></description>
